MainPageViewModel --> TimeContainer
MainPageViewModel --> ClockGraphics
MainPageViewModel --> ClockMode
MainPageViewModel --> DrawMath
MainPageViewModel --> LoggingUtility

LoggingUtility --> Logger

TimeConverters --> LoggingUtility

ClockGraphics --> ClockGraphicsData
